    <string name="e_timingmode_interval_note">Android runs background updates at most every 15 minutes, and may delay them a little in Doze to save battery.</string>
    <string name="e_timingmode_daily_note">Once a day, at a time Android picks to save battery.</string>
    <string name="e_timingmode_slideshow_note">Fast changes (down to 5 s) handled by your launcher while the home screen is visible. Some launchers pause or restart it; the order may restart when the widget is redrawn.</string>
    <string name="e_timingmode_unlock_note">Best effort: Android only tells running apps about unlocks, so this works while Widglet is in memory. Tap still works any time.</string>
    <string name="e_timingmode_screen_on_note">Best effort: Android only tells running apps when the screen turns on, so this works while Widglet is in memory.</string>
    <string name="e_timingmode_tap_note">Changes only when you tap the widget.</string>
    <string name="e_timingmode_manual_note">Changes only from the app, the Quick Settings tile or the app shortcut.</string>

